            "review_title": "Review at Little Ba Na Hills",
            "review_text": "Linh B\nHanoi419 contributions\n0\nPerfect spot and amazing food for Breakfast, Lunch or Dinner\nMar 2024 • Friends\nDelicious meals with good coffee. Eat here twice for breakfast and come back for dinner. Little Bana Hills surprise me with their beef noodle first time, taste like the best Pho stall in Hanoi. Second time I tried slow cook beef with bread and it won me over again with the tender beef that melted in your mouth , perfect seasoning…\nCoffee is good and fresh beer in the evening with Bana sausage is unbeatable combo.\nI will come back for more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 5, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
